        "comments": "The assembly pxPlaMala3 is based on PacBio HiFi data and Arima Hi-C data generated by the Lawniczak Group based in the Sanger Tree of Life Programme. The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: mapping of the HiFi data to human reference genome and obtaining unmapped reads, using these unmapped reads for initial PacBio assembly generation with hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHifi. Finally, the assembly was analysed and manually improved using gEVAL. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named, ordered and oriented based on published data.",
